{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:07 2026-10-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:07 2026-10-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:07 2026-10-01 HKT</p><p>今日（1日）清晨6時10分，北京天安門廣場舉行國慶升旗儀式，數萬名群眾通宵守候，慶祝中華人民共和國成立77周年。</p><img alt=\"北京天安門廣場舉行升旗儀式慶祝國慶。央視截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/52d2e8cd580904fd4d9afa80ae126be7/2026-10/eJaqnGcSlx08BdFPaqzC01041207xdkq0E030_mp4_snapshot_04_40__2026_10_01_08_00_33_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"北京天安門廣場舉行升旗儀式慶祝國慶。央視截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3c01d3be7dde367c98d75289e4ed6e4a/2026-10/eJaqnGcSlx08BdFPaqzC01041207xdkq0E030_mp4_snapshot_02_04__2026_10_01_08_00_42_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"北京天安門廣場舉行升旗儀式慶祝國慶。央視截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c60601acc26b69108b5dfa611eb1b091/2026-10/eJaqnGcSlx08BdFPaqzC01041207xdkq0E030_mp4_snapshot_03_52__2026_10_01_08_00_27_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"北京天安門廣場舉行升旗儀式慶祝國慶。央視截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bc71ea7e212ca89addc380060c6a7f08/2026-10/eJaqnGcSlx08BdFPaqzC01041207xdkq0E030_mp4_snapshot_02_23__2026_10_01_08_00_21_.jpg\"/><img alt=\"北京天安門廣場舉行升旗儀式慶祝國慶。央視截圖\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f8edd466f70952b4800f411f5d4049c/2026-10/gWI6oG8wlx08BdFpMjsk0104120127w20E010_mp4_snapshot_00_08__2026_10_01_07_59_43_.jpg\"/><p>除了儀仗隊步入廣場後，現場播放國歌，並升起國旗，隨後放飛萬多隻和平鴿，現場氣氛熱烈。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T00:19:58.033458+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}